  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added Option<T> type (Rust-inspired optional values with zero heap allocation). Renamed Result API to Rust-parity conventions (IsOk, IsErr, Map, AndThen, etc.) with deprecated shims for backwards compatibility. Added [BitField] reversed bit-order acceptance and End+Width Start derivation. Added optional 'Saturating' parameter on [BitField] properties to clamp values to fit the bit width. Removed the deprecated [BitFieldsView] attribute -- use the [BitFields] attribute on 'record struct' types instead.",
